    "updated_at": "2016-10-05T19:52:21Z",
    "body": "Ignoring the amp and msapplication parts which are not related to web standards, as far as I can tell this is a desire to be able to access the page's theme color from CSS. Thus it probably belongs in the CSSWG instead of the HTML Standard, but I'm happy to host the discussion here while we try to nail things down a bit better.\n",
